  {
   "sid": "s7",
   "date": null,
   "url": "https://www.energy.gov/nnsa/articles/nnsa-announces-aires-tide-national-security-innovation-developed-using-ai-and",
   "text": "Aires Tide is a remarkable early demonstration of how NNSA is putting the Genesis Mission into action,” said NNSA Administrator Brandon Williams. “President Trump has made it clear that America must lead the world in artificial intelligence and use emerging technologies to strengthen our national security. By combining AI, high-performance computing, and additive manufacturing, we are pioneering a faster, more efficient model to design and produce capabilities for national security while keeping human judgment firmly at the center.",
   "source_type": "official_statement",
   "attribution": {
    "kind": "personal",
    "speaker": "Brandon Williams",
    "organization_id": "energy",
    "basis": "local_span",
