   "date": "2025-12-01",
   "url": "https://www.energy.gov/nnsa/articles/nnsa-demonstrates-swift-action-genesis-mission",
   "text": "“President Trump’s Genesis Mission provides a clear mandate, and we are responding with immediate action. This RFI is a critical step in harnessing the immense power of AI to enact the White House’s vision for America to lead in every aspect of AI.”",
