   "date": "2026-06-24",
   "url": "https://www.energy.gov/nnsa/articles/nnsa-announces-aires-tide-national-security-innovation-developed-using-ai-and",
   "text": "President Trump has made it clear that America must lead the world in artificial intelligence and use emerging technologies to strengthen our national security. By combining AI, high-performance computing, and additive manufacturing, we are pioneering a faster, more efficient model to design and produce capabilities for national security while keeping human judgment firmly at the center.",
   "source_type": "official_statement",
